                <span id="algx2.l13.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">UpdateMetadata<math id="algx2.l13.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="(\mathcal{N}_{\text{archiver}},e.\texttt{new\_info\_neighbor}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mtext>archiver</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">new_info_neighbor</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\mathcal{N}_{\text{archiver}},e.\texttt{new\_info\_neighbor}</annotation></semantics></math></span> <span id="algx2.l13.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="algx2.l13.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Refine neighbor metadata
</span>
</div>
<div id="algx2.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
