<div id="A4.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Thought: To find the top goalscorer before Landon Donovan, I need to identify the player with the most goals scored, excluding Landon Donovan. Since the table is already sorted by the number of goals in descending order, I can look at the second row to find the player with the next highest number of goals.</p>
