<p id="A4.I2.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Intermediate table: &lt;NOT CHANGED&gt;</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I2.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I2.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I2.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Answer: Clint Dempsey</p>
